# Title: PowerShell Deleted Mounted Share
# ID: 66a4d409-451b-4151-94f4-a55d559c49b0
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: oscd.community, @redcanary, Zach Stanford @svch0st
# Date: 2020-10-08
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1070.005
# Description: Detects when when a mounted share is removed. Adversaries may remove share connections that are no longer useful in order to clean up traces of their operation
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((ScriptBlockText:*Remove-SmbShare* OR ScriptBlockText:*Remove-FileShare*)) AND NOT (((ScriptBlockText:*FileShare.cdxml* AND ScriptBlockText:*Microsoft.PowerShell.Core\\Export-ModuleMember* AND ScriptBlockText:*ROOT/Microsoft/Windows/Storage/MSFT_FileShare* AND ScriptBlockText:*ObjectModelWrapper* AND ScriptBlockText:*Cmdletization.MethodParameter*))))
